<title>How bees talk</title>
<h>How bees talk</h>
A honeybee that finds flowers flies back to the hive and does a
<b>waggle dance</b>. The angle of the dance says which direction to fly,
and how long she waggles says how far. It's a protocol!
The other bees have to agree on what the dance means, just like
Alice and Bob agreed on their codebook.
